<article class="env-lemma" id="FC24E6">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/FC24E6">Lemma <span data-tag="FC24E6">2.2.3.10</span>.</a> For each integer $n \geq 0$, the unstraightening functor $Un_{\Delta ^ n}: (\Set _{\Delta }^{\sCoNerve [\Delta ^ n]})^{\circ } \rightarrow \RFib (\Delta ^ n)$ is an equivalence of simplicial categories. </p>
</article>
<article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      In view of Lemma <a href="/tag/11EDA3" data-tag="11EDA3">2.2.3.9</a> and Proposition <a href="/tag/6957FA" data-tag="6957FA">8.3.1.10</a>, it will suffice to show that the Quillen adjunction $( St_{\Delta ^ n}, Un_{\Delta ^ n} )$ is a Quillen equivalence. This follows immediately from Lemma <a href="/tag/BEAD69" data-tag="BEAD69">2.2.3.1</a> and Proposition <a href="/tag/" data-tag="">None</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>